  description: '2 Level 1 monsters

    Once per turn, during either player''s turn:
    You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card; your opponent randomly chooses
    1 card in your Extra Deck, and if it is a "Number" monster that has a number
    between "1" and "99" in its name, Special Summon it by using this face-up card
    you control as the Xyz Material, but banish that monster during the End Phase,
    also you cannot Special Summon for the rest of this turn. (This is treated as
    an Xyz Summon. Xyz Materials attached to this card also become Xyz Materials
    on the Summoned monster.)'
